		<div class="faq">
			<details class="faq__item">
				<summary>Is Envy really free?</summary>
				<p>
					Yes. Envy is open source under the MIT license — every feature, free,
					on every platform. No trial, no license keys, no account. The source
					lives on <a href="<?= htmlspecialchars($github) ?>">GitHub</a>, and you
